        "tooltip": "<span>Begin Charging: </span>Vladimir charges up a reservoir of blood, spending up to <span style=\"color: #CC3300\">(8% Health) Health</span>. While at full charge, Vladimir is <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 20%.<br /><br /><span>Release: </span>Vladimir unleashes a torrent of blood missiles at surrounding enemies, dealing between <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(30/45/60/75/90 + (1.5% Health) + (35% Ability Power))</span> and <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/90/120/150/180 + (6% Health) + (80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> based on charge time. If this Ability was charged for at least 1 second, it also <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> targets by 40/45/50/55/60% for 0.5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability releases automatically after 1.5 seconds.<br />Enemies can be hit by multiple blood missiles, but take no damage after the first.<br /></span>",
